  "description": "Eclaire Pistache is a rich, dessert-inspired gourmand fragrance centered around creamy pistachio and smooth milky sweetness. The scent feels indulgent, cozy, and addictive, like a refined pistachio pastry with a soft, modern finish. The opening features pistachio cream and toasted pistachio, delivering a nutty, creamy, and slightly roasted sweetness that immediately feels warm and edible. The heart develops into whipped cream, coconut, and cacao, adding a soft, airy sweetness with a chocolatey and creamy texture that enhances the dessert-like feel. The base settles into vanilla, milk, and musk, creating a smooth, milky, and long-lasting finish that feels cozy, comforting, and softly sweet on the skin. Eclaire Pistache is perfect for those who enjoy creamy gourmand fragrances with a nutty twist and a soft, comforting dry-down.",
